{"id":"01_5544","type":"item","name":{"ja":"RG 1/144 シャイニングガンダム","en":"RG 1/144 Shining Gundam"},"description":[{"ja":"（2024/12/20記載）諸般の都合により、商品の発売月を変更させていただきました。","en":"(Posted on 2024/12/20) Due to various circumstances, we have changed the product release."},{"ja":"『機動武闘伝G ガンダム』より、「シャイニングガンダム」をリアルな外観と可動機構を追求したRGならではの“スーパーモード”への変形を搭載し商品化！","en":"From \"Mobile Fighter G Gundam \", the \" Shining Gundam \" has been commercialized with a transformation to RG's unique \" Super Mode\" that pursues a realistic appearance and movable mechanism!"},{"ja":"• 全身の可動機構を追求し、“スーパーモード”を差し替えなしで再現。","en":"• Pursuing the movable mechanism of the whole body, \"Super mode\" is reproduced without replacement."},{"ja":"• 頭部の“スーパーモード”への変形も差し替え不要。","en":"• There is no need to replace the head to transform it into “super mode”."},{"ja":"• ショルダーカバーの展開をリアルな質感やディテールで演出。","en":"• The shoulder cover unfolds with realistic texture and detail."},{"ja":"• アームカバーは引き出しと展開ギミックを搭載。","en":"• The arm cover is equipped with a drawer and an unfolding gimmick."},{"ja":"• レッグカバーの展開に連動し内部バーニアが露出。","en":"• The internal vernier is exposed as the leg cover unfolds."},{"ja":"• つま先が前方に延長しつつアンクルカバーが後方に回転することで安定感がアップ。","en":"• The ankle cover rotates backwards while the toes extend forward, increasing the sense of stability."},{"ja":"• “ヒト”の動きを徹底追求。可動に最適化したフレーム構造を採用し、よりしなやかなポージングが可能。","en":"• Thorough pursuit of human movement. Adopts a frame structure optimized for movement, allowing for more flexible posing."},{"ja":"• 首には3軸可動に加え、スイング機構を搭載することで躍動感あるポーズ演出が可能に。","en":"• In addition to 3-axis movement, the neck is equipped with a swing mechanism, making it possible to create dynamic poses."},{"ja":"• 「シャイニングフィンガー」用のハンドパーツが付属。その他にもポージングの幅を広げる表情豊かなハンドパーツが付属。","en":"• Hand parts for \"Shining Finger\" are included. In addition, expressive hand parts are included to expand the range of poses."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"ビームソード×2種","en":"Beam sword x 2 types"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"リアリスティックデカール